# Build context hygiene: keep non-runtime files OUT of every image so the
# shipped images carry no host deps, build caches, tests, docs or CI config.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.git
**/uploads
**/*.log
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Tests + test tooling never belong in a runtime image (W2-6).
**/test
**/tests
**/__tests__
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
**/*.spec.ts
**/*.spec.tsx
**/e2e
**/playwright.config.*
**/vitest.config.*
playwright-report
test-results

# Docs, CI and editor/OS cruft are not needed to build or run the app.
docs
.github
**/*.md
!**/README.md
.vscode
.idea
**/.DS_Store
